  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Private Sector Fund of the Global Agriculture and Food Security Programme to make loans to private sector organisations for food security and agriculture projects in developing countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to the Private Sector Fund of the Global Agriculture and Food Security Programme to make loans to private sector organisations for food security and agriculture projects in developing countries is a component of Support to the Global Agriculture and Food Security Programme (GAFSP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;77,100,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Food assistance, Social Protection, Disaster prevention and preparedness.</narrative>
  </description>
